From 43dc43dd8155f853b44420e96b8a501c3f78678c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rivet-agent-lpl <rivet@rollerbot.ai>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:41:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: run the scenario evaluator beside verify

EVALUATE delegates to livingproof-evaluator-scenario at the pull-request
commit. A scenario-evaluator job writes its own result files, and the report
job appends every evaluator-results artifact onto the bundle. Repin the
package to its release tag before merge.
